  "articleBody": "Start by confirming that the garage can legally become habitable space, then document its dimensions and existing utilities, develop a bedroom plan, resolve parking and emergency-exit requirements, obtain approvals, and complete construction inspections. A careful preconstruction review helps prevent an attractive room from failing because of zoning, moisture, ceiling-height, or life-safety issues.",
